OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeking government cash
OL,4,Asupport to plug #9.6m deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in part of Greater
OL,7,FManchester could face service cuts and
OL,8,Ftax increases after a council revealed
OL,9,Fit is seeking emergency financial aid
OL,10,Ffrom the government.
OL,12,FFinance bosses at Bury Council have
OL,13,Fsaid rising costs and dwindling
OL,14,Freserves mean they are not able to
OL,15,Fbalance the books without intervention,
OL,16,Fand there could be a three-year budget
OL,17,Fgap of #35m.
OL,19,FEven with savings identified, that gap
OL,20,Fis expected to come to #9.6m for the
OL,21,Fcoming financial year, and rising to
OL,22,F#17.5m at the end of three years.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
